WEBVTT

00:06:59.636 --> 00:07:02.476
a growing producer and a big consumer,

00:07:02.476 --> 00:07:03.916
has agreed to follow suit.

00:07:04.596 --> 00:07:06.996
And while not a party to the agreement --

00:07:06.996 --> 00:07:08.156
yet --

00:07:08.156 --> 00:07:11.636
the United States announced
in September 2021

00:07:11.636 --> 00:07:14.956
a new regulation that would insist

00:07:14.956 --> 00:07:20.636
that US manufacturers reduce
HFCs by 85 percent

00:07:20.636 --> 00:07:22.116
in the next 15 years.

00:07:22.716 --> 00:07:26.956
Now what’s interesting
is that there are existing,

00:07:26.956 --> 00:07:28.796
emissions-free,

00:07:28.796 --> 00:07:30.876
non-polluting technologies